## A note on early-stage transparency

Aescia is an early-stage company preparing for its first clinical feasibility evaluation. We believe credibility comes from honest disclosure about what the company is and what it isn't — at the stage it is at, not the stage it intends to reach.

This means:

- We will not name institutions that have not approved public disclosure
- We will not imply partnerships, endorsements, or deployments that have not occurred
- We will update this page as the company's relationships and team develop and those relationships become appropriate to disclose

If you are a clinician, governance lead, or health technology specialist interested in contributing to Aescia's development, we are interested in hearing from you.

